      "citation": "Ventura-León, J., Sánchez-Villena, A. R., Caycho-Rodríguez, T., Barboza-Palomino, M., & Rubio, A. (2020). Fear of loneliness: Development and validation of a brief scale. Frontiers in Psychology, 11. https://doi.org/10.3389/fpsyg.2020.583396",
